Tools used: Excel, Power BI, Word.

This project started as a proposal I gave to my store leadership where I wanted to collect different KPIs over the course of 5 weeks and with that information I was going to build a project discussing the
biggest obstacle we face in the Online Pickup Department (OPD) which is called Nil Picks (Not-In-Location) Picks.

This idea was approved and me myself collected the data and alongside some guidelines they gave me I built the project where I created an Excel file with all the metrics I collected and a dashboard in
Power BI to display and compare correlation with different KPIs.
